{"text":"purananuru","n":101,"lines":["ஒருநாள் செல்லலம் இருநாட் செல்லலம்","பன்னாள் பயின்று பலரொடு செல்லினும்","தலைநாள் பொன்ற விருப்பினன் மாதோ","அணிபூண் அணிந்த யானை இயல்தேர்","அதியமான் பரிசில் பெறூஉங் காலம்","நீட்டினும் நீட்டா தாயினும் யானைதன்","கோட்டிடை வைத்த கவளம் போலக்","கையகத் தது அது பொய்யா காதே","அருந்தே மாந்த நெஞ்சம்","வருந்த வேண்டா வாழ்க அவன் தாளே"],"tr":["orunāḷ cellalam irunāṭ cellalam","paṉṉāḷ payiṉṟu palaroṭu celliṉum","talaināḷ poṉṟa viruppiṉaṉ mātō","aṇipūṇ aṇinta yāṉai iyaltēr","atiyamāṉ paricil peṟūuṅ kālam","nīṭṭiṉum nīṭṭā tāyiṉum yāṉaitaṉ","kōṭṭiṭai vaitta kavaḷam pōlak","kaiyakat tatu atu poyyā kātē","aruntē mānta neñcam","varunta vēṇṭā vāḻka avaṉ tāḷē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pāṭāṇ","tinai_ta":"பாடாண்","turai_ta":"பரிசில் கடா நிலை","poet_ta":"ஔவையார்,","addressed_ta":"அதியமான் நெடுமான் அஞ்சி","poet_tr":"Auvaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"10 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"9×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 37, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 20, āciriyattaḷai 18"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"ஒருநாள்","tr":"orunāḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ஒரு","tr":"oru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாள்","tr":"nāḷ"}]},{"text":"செல்லல","tr":"cellala","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செல்","tr":"cel"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லல","tr":"lala"}]},{"text":"மிருநாட்","tr":"mirunāṭ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மிரு","tr":"miru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாட்","tr":"nāṭ"}]},{"text":"செல்லலம்","tr":"cellalam","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செல்","tr":"cel"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லலம்","tr":"lalam"}]}],[{"text":"பன்னாள்","tr":"paṉṉāḷ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பன்","tr":"paṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னாள்","tr":"ṉāḷ"}]},{"text":"பயின்று","tr":"payiṉṟu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பயின்","tr":"payiṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"பலரொடு","tr":"palaroṭu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பல","tr":"pala"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரொடு","tr":"roṭu"}]},{"text":"செல்லினும்","tr":"celliṉum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செல்","tr":"cel"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லினும்","tr":"liṉum"}]}],[{"text":"தலைநாள்","tr":"talaināḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலை","tr":"talai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாள்","tr":"nāḷ"}]},{"text":"பொன்ற","tr":"poṉṟa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொன்","tr":"poṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ற","tr":"ṟa"}]},{"text":"விருப்பினன்","tr":"viruppiṉaṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"விருப்","tr":"virup"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பினன்","tr":"piṉaṉ"}]},{"text":"மாதோ","tr":"mātō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"}]}],[{"text":"வணிபூ","tr":"vaṇipū","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வணி","tr":"vaṇi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூ","tr":"pū"}]},{"text":"ணணிந்த","tr":"ṇaṇinta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணணிந்","tr":"ṇaṇin"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"யானை","tr":"yāṉai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னை","tr":"ṉai"}]},{"text":"யியல்தே","tr":"yiyaltē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யியல்","tr":"yiyal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]}],[{"text":"ரதியமான்","tr":"ratiyamāṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரதி","tr":"rati"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யமான்","tr":"yamāṉ"}]},{"text":"பரிசில்","tr":"paricil","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பரி","tr":"pari"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சில்","tr":"cil"}]},{"text":"பெறூஉங்","tr":"peṟūuṅ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெறூ","tr":"peṟū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"உங்","tr":"uṅ"}]},{"text":"காலம்","tr":"kālam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லம்","tr":"lam"}]}],[{"text":"நீட்டினும்","tr":"nīṭṭiṉum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீட்","tr":"nīṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டினும்","tr":"ṭiṉum"}]},{"text":"நீட்டா","tr":"nīṭṭā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீட்","tr":"nīṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டா","tr":"ṭā"}]},{"text":"தாயினும்","tr":"tāyiṉum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினும்","tr":"yiṉum"}]},{"text":"யானைதன்","tr":"yāṉaitaṉ","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னை","tr":"ṉai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"}]}],[{"text":"கோட்டிடை","tr":"kōṭṭiṭai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோட்","tr":"kōṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டிடை","tr":"ṭiṭai"}]},{"text":"வைத்த","tr":"vaitta","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வைத்","tr":"vait"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"கவளம்","tr":"kavaḷam","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கவ","tr":"kava"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளம்","tr":"ḷam"}]},{"text":"போலக்","tr":"pōlak","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லக்","tr":"lak"}]}],[{"text":"கையகத்","tr":"kaiyakat","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யகத்","tr":"yakat"}]},{"text":"ததுவது","tr":"tatuvatu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தது","tr":"tatu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வது","tr":"vatu"}]},{"text":"பொய்யா","tr":"poyyā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொய்","tr":"poy"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"}]},{"text":"காதே","tr":"kātē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]}],[{"text":"யருந்தே","tr":"yaruntē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யருந்","tr":"yarun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]},{"text":"மாந்த","tr":"mānta","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மாந்","tr":"mān"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"நெஞ்சம்","tr":"neñcam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நெஞ்","tr":"neñ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சம்","tr":"cam"}]}],[{"text":"வருந்த","tr":"varunta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வருந்","tr":"varun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"வேண்டா","tr":"vēṇṭā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேண்","tr":"vēṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டா","tr":"ṭā"}]},{"text":"வாழ்க","tr":"vāḻka","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாழ்","tr":"vāḻ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"க","tr":"ka"}]},{"text":"வவன்தாளே","tr":"vavaṉtāḷē","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வவன்","tr":"vavaṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளே","tr":"ḷē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"ஒருநாள்","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"oru","gloss":"one"},{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"nāḷ","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"one day"},{"surface":"செல்லலம்","parts":[{"text":"செல்","lemma":"cel","gloss":"go"},{"text":"அல்","lemma":"al","gloss":"not"},{"text":"அம்","lemma":"am","gloss":"we"}],"gloss":"we do not go"},{"surface":"இருநாள்","parts":[{"text":"இரு","lemma":"iru","gloss":"two"},{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"nāḷ","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"two days"},{"surface":"செல்லலம்","parts":[{"text":"செல்","lemma":"cel","gloss":"go"},{"text":"அல்","lemma":"al","gloss":"not"},{"text":"அம்","lemma":"am","gloss":"we"}],"gloss":"we do not go"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பன்னாள்","parts":[{"text":"பல்","lemma":"pal","gloss":"many"},{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"nāḷ","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"many days"},{"surface":"பயின்று","parts":[{"text":"பயின்று","lemma":"பயின்று","gloss":"frequenting"}],"gloss":"frequenting","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பலரொடு","parts":[{"text":"பலர்","lemma":"palar","gloss":"many people"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"oṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with many people"},{"surface":"செல்லினும்","parts":[{"text":"செல்","lemma":"cel","gloss":"go"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"if"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even if we go"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தலைநாள்","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"talai","gloss":"first"},{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"nāḷ","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"the first day"},{"surface":"பொன்ற","parts":[{"text":"பொன்ற","lemma":"poṉṟa","gloss":"to be similar"}],"gloss":"similar to"},{"surface":"விருப்பினன்","parts":[{"text":"விருப்பு","lemma":"viruppu","gloss":"affection"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"inflectional increment"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he has affection"},{"surface":"மாதோ","parts":[{"text":"மாதோ","lemma":"மாதோ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அணிபூண்","parts":[{"text":"அணி","lemma":"aṇi","gloss":"beautiful"},{"text":"பூண்","lemma":"pūṇ","gloss":"ornaments"}],"gloss":"beautiful ornaments"},{"surface":"அணிந்த","parts":[{"text":"அணிந்த","lemma":"அணிந்த","gloss":"adorned"}],"gloss":"adorned","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"yāṉai","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"},{"surface":"இயல்தேர்","parts":[{"text":"இயல்","lemma":"iyal","gloss":"moving"},{"text":"தேர்","lemma":"tēr","gloss":"chariot"}],"gloss":"moving chariot"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அதியமான்","parts":[{"text":"அதியமான்","lemma":"atiyamāṉ","gloss":"Athiyaman"}],"gloss":"Athiyaman"},{"surface":"பரிசில்","parts":[{"text":"பரிசில்","lemma":"paricil","gloss":"gift"}],"gloss":"gift"},{"surface":"பெறூஉம்","parts":[{"text":"பெறூஉம்","lemma":"பெறூஉம்","gloss":"receiving"}],"gloss":"receiving","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காலம்","parts":[{"text":"காலம்","lemma":"kālam","gloss":"time"}],"gloss":"time"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீட்டினும்","parts":[{"text":"நீட்டு","lemma":"nīṭṭu","gloss":"delay"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"if"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even if delayed"},{"surface":"நீட்டாதாயினும்","parts":[{"text":"நீட்டாது","lemma":"nīṭṭātu","gloss":"without delaying"},{"text":"ஆயினும்","lemma":"āyiṉum","gloss":"even if it is"}],"gloss":"or even if not delayed"},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"yāṉai","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"},{"surface":"தன்","parts":[{"text":"தன்","lemma":"taṉ","gloss":"its"}],"gloss":"its"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கோட்டிடை","parts":[{"text":"கோட்டிடை","lemma":"கோட்டிடை","gloss":"between the tusks"}],"gloss":"between the tusks","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வைத்த","parts":[{"text":"வை","lemma":"vai","gloss":"place"},{"text":"த்த","lemma":"tta","gloss":"past relative participle"}],"gloss":"placed"},{"surface":"கவளம்","parts":[{"text":"கவளம்","lemma":"kavaḷam","gloss":"mouthful of food"}],"gloss":"mouthful of food"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"pōla","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கையகத்தது","parts":[{"text":"கையகத்தது","lemma":"கையகத்தது","gloss":"it is in the hand"}],"gloss":"it is in the hand","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அது","parts":[{"text":"அது","lemma":"atu","gloss":"that"}],"gloss":"that"},{"surface":"பொய்யாகாதே","parts":[{"text":"பொய்","lemma":"poy","gloss":"falsehood"},{"text":"ஆகாது","lemma":"ākātu","gloss":"will not become"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"will not fail indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அருந்தேமாந்த","parts":[{"text":"அருந்தேமாந்த","lemma":"அருந்தேமாந்த","gloss":"longing to enjoy"}],"gloss":"longing to enjoy","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நெஞ்சம்","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சம்","lemma":"neñcam","gloss":"heart"}],"gloss":"heart"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வருந்த","parts":[{"text":"வருந்து","lemma":"varuntu","gloss":"grieve"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to grieve"},{"surface":"வேண்டா","parts":[{"text":"வேண்டு","lemma":"vēṇṭu","gloss":"need"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ā","gloss":"negative suffix"}],"gloss":"do not"},{"surface":"வாழ்க","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்","lemma":"vāḻ","gloss":"live"},{"text":"க","lemma":"ka","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"may live"},{"surface":"அவன்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"avaṉ","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"his"},{"surface":"தாளே","parts":[{"text":"தாள்","lemma":"tāḷ","gloss":"feet"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"feet indeed"}]}],"literal":"One day we go not, two days we go not, / many days frequenting, with many people even if we go, / like the first day, he has desire indeed, / adorned with beautiful ornaments, having elephants and moving chariots, / Athiyaman's gift receiving time, / even if delayed, or even if not delayed, like an elephant's / mouthful of food placed between its tusks, / it is in the hand, that will not fail indeed! / O heart longing to enjoy, / do not grieve! May his feet live long!","translation":"Whether we go to him for one day, or for two days, or frequent his court for many days along with many others, he remains as full of affection for us as he was on the very first day. The time of receiving gifts from Athiyaman, who possesses elephants adorned with beautiful ornaments and swift chariots, may be delayed or it may not be delayed; but like a mouthful of food held between the tusks of an elephant, it is already as good as in our hands and will never fail. Therefore, O heart that longs to enjoy his bounty, do not grieve! May his feet live long!","modern":"ஒரு நாள் சென்றாலும், இரண்டு நாட்கள் சென்றாலும், பல நாட்கள் பலருடன் சேர்ந்து சென்றாலும், முதல் நாள் காட்டிய அதே அன்போடு அதியமான் விளங்குகிறான். அழகிய அணிகலன்களை அணிந்த யானைகளையும் இயங்கும் தேர்களையும் உடைய அதியமானிடம் பரிசு பெறும் காலம் நீட்டித்தாலும் அல்லது நீட்டியாது உடனே கிடைத்தாலும், அது யானையின் தந்தங்களுக்கு இடையே வைக்கப்பட்ட கவளம் போல நம் கையில் உள்ளதே ஆகும்; அது ஒருபோதும் பொய்க்காது. எனவே, அவனது கொடையை நுகர ஏங்கும் நெஞ்சமே, நீ வருந்த வேண்டாம்! அவனுடைய தாள் வாழ்க!","explanation":"This poem is set in the Puram genre under the theme of 'paricil kaṭā nilai' (soliciting gifts), where the poet Avvaiyar praises the patron Athiyaman Neduman Anji. Avvaiyar reassures her own heart, which is anxious about the delay in receiving gifts from the king. She compares Athiyaman's assured generosity to a mouthful of food held between the tusks of an elephant, which is safe and destined to be eaten, meaning the gift is as secure as if it were already in their hands. The poem beautifully captures the deep trust between the poet and the patron, emphasizing that his affection never diminishes regardless of how often or with how many people they visit. Key words include 'paricil' (gift), 'kavaḷam' (mouthful of food), and 'neñcam' (heart).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}